#: data/in.gxanshu.postcard.metainfo.xml.in:10
msgid ""
"Postcard is a fast, modern email client for the GNOME desktop, built with "
"GTK 4 and libadwaita. It follows the same three-pane layout as Geary — "
"folders, conversations, and reading pane — with a clean, native feel and "
"nothing to configure to get started beyond your account details."
msgstr ""

#: data/in.gxanshu.postcard.metainfo.xml.in:16
msgid "Features include:"
msgstr ""

#: data/in.gxanshu.postcard.metainfo.xml.in:18
msgid "Multiple IMAP/SMTP accounts"
msgstr ""

#: data/in.gxanshu.postcard.metainfo.xml.in:19
msgid "Conversations grouped into threads"
msgstr ""

#: data/in.gxanshu.postcard.metainfo.xml.in:20
msgid "Instant full-text search across your mail"
msgstr ""

#: data/in.gxanshu.postcard.metainfo.xml.in:21
msgid "Offline reading from a local cache"
msgstr ""

#: data/in.gxanshu.postcard.metainfo.xml.in:22
msgid ""
"HTML and plain-text mail, with remote images blocked until you allow them"
msgstr ""

#: data/in.gxanshu.postcard.metainfo.xml.in:23
msgid ""
"Compose, reply, and forward, with Cc/Bcc, a signature, and a Drafts/Outbox "
"that never loses a message"
msgstr ""

#: data/in.gxanshu.postcard.metainfo.xml.in:25
msgid "Archive, trash, move, and undo, with desktop notifications for new mail"
msgstr ""

